{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology' data-target='computer\/technology' data-title='Technology'>\r\n\t\t\tTechnology\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Open-source licenses as availability plus usability; GPL v2 Tivoization versus v3, and mere aggregation.","label":"License","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/technology\/hardware","label":"Hardware","url":"\/computer\/technology\/hardware"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/technology\/llm","label":"LLM","url":"\/computer\/technology\/llm"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t\t<div class='content-image-container'>\r\n\t<div class='cover-image cover-image-tile'>\r\n\t\t<img src='\/computer\/technology\/license.svg' alt='Open-source licenses as availability plus usability; GPL v2 Tivoization versus v3, and mere aggregation.' style='object-fit: contain; object-position: center'>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p class='cover-credit'>\n\t<span class='cover-credit-anchor'>\n\t\t<button type='button' class='cover-credit-toggle' aria-expanded='false' aria-label='Image credit'>\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16' width='14' height='14' aria-hidden='true' focusable='false'>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='8' r='6.25' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.2'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='5.2' r='0.85' fill='currentColor'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<path fill='currentColor' d='M7.28 7.15h1.44v4.55H7.28z'\/>\n\t\t\t<\/svg>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t<span class='cover-credit-popup'><a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/File%3ACC-logo.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Creative Commons<\/a> \/ <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/File%3ACC-logo.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a> \u2014 <span>Public domain<\/span><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>Open-source licenses as availability plus usability; GPL v2 Tivoization versus v3, and mere aggregation.<\/h2>\n\t\t<p>\n\t\tOpen-source license:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Availability<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Usability<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h2>Availability<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSoftware source code may be available in read-only format.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Usability<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThe rights that come with the software:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>To run (Right 0)<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>To distribute copies<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>To modify<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>To distribute modifications<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h2>GPL<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tGNU General Public License.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>v2<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tLinux. Did not require a not-locking clause. \"Tivo\"-fication.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>v3<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNot liked by Linus Trovalds \u2014 as it imposes conditions to prevent locking modification as in the case of Tivofication.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>MereAggregation<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIn this case the other product does not have to come under GPL.\n\t<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/license\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/license\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/hardware' data-target='computer\/technology\/hardware' data-title='Hardware' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible item_block_image_contain' src='\/computer\/technology\/hardware.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Hardware<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/technology\/llm' data-target='computer\/technology\/llm' data-title='LLM' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible item_block_image_contain' src='\/computer\/technology\/llm.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>LLM<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/technology' data-target='computer\/technology' data-title='Technology'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/technology.jpg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Technology<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}